WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.310
I-It's fine by me...

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:56.630
For some reason, it's come to this...

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:59.550
And I don't know how...

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.970
...it's come to this...

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:09.350
But... I really don't understand how I was the one to suggest it...

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.480
Ah, geez! He's already getting naked!

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:32.920
If I were to say something like "let's stop here" now...

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:36.920
I can't...

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.930
I-It's embarrassing, so turn around.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.430
Okay.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:52.940
I... I can't make a fuss about this now.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.960
Y-You can turn around now.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.850
You haven't taken anything off.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.810
I-It's okay like this.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.900
I'll take everything off one by one...

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.810
No, instead... you undress me.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.320
Wow...

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.030
I can't believe I said something as stupid...

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.820
...as telling him to take off my clothes!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.530
But at a time like this...

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.790
...I don't know what to do, or what to say...

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:53.880
Takahashi.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:54.790
Y-Yes?!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.920
Raise your head.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.800
B-But... I don't know where to look.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.310
Don't worry, Takahashi.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.850
Just think of it like you're at the beach.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.520
This is the beach.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.860
You're on the sandy dunes.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.860
I'm in swimming trunks.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.320
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.450
Now, why don't you change into your bikini, Nana-chan?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.740
Crap! I laughed!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.250
But... I see.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.750
This is the beach.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:36.960
The beach.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.460
The beach!

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.890
If you're scared, we can stop here.

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.650
I don't want to make you regret this.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:06.160
Takahashi, I want to do something that will make us both happy.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.450
Didn't I tell you?

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.660
I don't just want your body.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.160
If you feel like you're pushing yourself even a little, then it's wrong.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.750
Don't make a mistake.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.180
I want love.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.850
I know... I'm not making a mistake.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.860
Please make me your own.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.820
Hurry!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:55.000
Hurry...

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.560
This is bad... even I'm starting to get nervous.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:24.150
I see... so even guys get nervous.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.530
I see...

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.330
Well... without holding back...

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.250
...I will let you give yourself to me.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.670
Huh? My Japanese is weird.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:42.920
I'll have you.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.550
Well, whatever.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.600
If it hurts, please raise your right hand.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.560
Are you a dentist or something?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.190
I won't regret this at all.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.780
There's no way I will.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:11.660
Mom, Dad... I'm sorry.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:16.330
I have someone I want to devote everything to.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.660
Everything...

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.040
...to the one precious to me, who's difficult to replace...

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.880
...with anything else in the world.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:31.880
Encountering him must have been destiny.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:40.430
And if anyone says differently, I won't believe in destiny at all.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:53.450
But even despite that, I wonder if I've been dreaming?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.500
Ever since that day...

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:10.510
...there's just been so much fortune... beauty... fascination...

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.970
...that the reality seems so dreamlike.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:22.100
Or is this all just a dream that seems so realistic?

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:26.610
A dream?

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:30.610
Ah, it's Yano.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.620
Huh? Why's he wearing a happi coat?

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.200
A happy dream? What's that?

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:44.500
Huh? He was talking about something else when he wore the happi coat...

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.130
The words they say at weddings sure are nice, huh?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.170
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:53.170
For a Christmas present... give me a promise.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.510
Not that, Yano...

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.970
Is this all just a dream?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.020
Or is this reali--

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.810
Ow!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.690
It's reality!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.400
It's reality! Thank goodness!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.150
But... it hurts!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.320
I think this sorta hurts, Yano!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.360
Right hand, right hand!

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:16.450
Ah, yeah. Sorry, Takahashi.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.950
Just stick with it for now!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:18.870
Sorry.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.580
Think of something else right now!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.990
How?!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.870
Think of something fun.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.580
Like what?!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:29.420
Umm... like you're cramming your mouth full of those steamed meat buns you love so much.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.750
Yeah, something full of happiness like that!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.380
What's up with that?!

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:48.100
Your mom's back!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.610
Crap! Get dressed! Get dressed!

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.020
Our study stuff is downstairs!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.190
I'll bring it with me, so sneak out of the house!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.900
Ah! She must've seen my shoes!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.030
Hurry!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:05.200
I can never show my face in front of your mom ever again...

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.620
Don't worry about it.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:09.500
Shouldn't something else be bugging you more?

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:13.840
After all, her coming home was the worst punch line ever...

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:14.670
Yeah, I guess so...

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.840
Isn't it funny? Like, really funny?

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.680
It's just so like us.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.100
Ah, sorry. Did I hurt your feelings?

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.220
Yeah, I'm a guy, after all.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.600
Anyway, Yano, you're dressed pretty lightly, aren't you?

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.690
I was in a rush.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.270
Don't be disappointed, Yano.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:38.650
But... I made such a huge thing out of it, and now I look completely uncool.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:42.950
And anyway, didn't it feel like a play, with all of those overdramatic lines?

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:43.870
Yeah...

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:47.460
Is this supposed to be a theatre? Who do you think you are?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.090
Please make me your own.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:02.300
I feel embarrassed about it now.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:07.310
But... I was moved by it.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:20.450
I'm so glad the person I love is Yano.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:25.740
But there's no chance that we'll make this an anniversary, huh?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.500
For our first...

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.590
No... you see...

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.130
I didn't even enter you!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.970
Though, I think you know that yourself.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.050
No penetration. No nothing.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.300
Not even my head.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.180
Ah... is that so...?

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.100
Yes.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:01.820
Should we head back, then?

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.120
Will things be okay with your mom?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.450
I'll pretend like nothing happened.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.100
Ah, damn it!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:34.060
Why'd the old hag have to come home at a time like that?!

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.690
I was almost there!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.650
My house is no good at all! Totally out of the question!

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:07.390
I love you.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:18.820
I love you.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:29.530
"Up until now, I've just thought of sex as a sport!"

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.330
"But I was wrong."

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.540
"Sex is something sacred."

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.870
What's that? Who told you that?

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:36.580
Yano.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.170
You serious?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.130
Last night, he came over to my place and said that with a straight face.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.300
Does he have a loose screw or something?

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.880
Or what? Is he really that into his current girlfriend?

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.010
Did he have sex with Takahashi?

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:47.640
Yeah, didn't you hear?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.100
No...

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:54.430
Is that her name? What's she like? I've never seen her before.

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.650
Ah... I saw them walking and holding hands once, but...

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:58.810
...she's kind of round.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:13:59.360
Round?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.860
She's really normal.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.030
She's so normal that you'd be surprised.

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.780
But she's a good girl.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.240
Well, isn't it fine the way it is, though?

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:06.860
How so?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.450
It means he's starting to heal from what happened with Nana-san, right?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.950
Who knows about that one?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.200
But you know, the one left behind just has to keep living.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:19.210
You should do more than just that. You should have the time of your life.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.210
Welcome!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.960
Your finest sake, please.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:26.220
Speaking of which, he had a couple screws loose when he was going out with Nana-san too, didn't he?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.640
Only 8,000 yen. A special bargain, just for you! But you have to pay up-front.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.520
How about it?

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.730
That's a little expensive. You sure you're not overcharging?

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.230
I bought them for 14,000 yen, and they're practically right out of the box.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.990
It's not expensive at all.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.660
How many times have you worn them?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.120
Maybe two or three times?

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.990
You're lying. They're dirty.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.870
Clean them off with an eraser.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.080
Then, how about this?

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.210
You still have more stuff?

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.120
I'll throw in a cap and this one-of-a-kind secret figure as a special service.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:00.960
What's up with that?

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.340
10,000 yen altogether.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.000
You're raising the price!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:04.920
What's up with you, anyway?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.970
What do you want to buy so badly?

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.470
For the shoes alone, 3,000 yen.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.470
7,500.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.470
3,250.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.350
6,000.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:14.350
3,500. I won't go any higher.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.350
I couldn't even pay for a hotel room with that.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:21.850
I'll get him. He's at the end of his rope.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.360
If you were selling your One Stars, I wouldn't mind paying 8,000 yen.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.940
Does he stare at my feet?!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.400
Screw you. I'm not selling them.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.070
8,000 yen's too cheap in the first place, moron.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.610
Then I'll pay for them using my Internet account.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.570
I need the cash right now. I'm in a rush.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.950
Hey, Yano-kun. I'll buy this.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:38.580
How much is it?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:39.580
2,000 yen.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.330
What are you saying? You're so funny.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.090
Here you go.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.340
What a cruel, cold world...

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:51.380
No... I think you're the cruel one here, no matter how I look at it.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.390
And I had my hair just right, too...

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.890
What do you mean, you had it just right?

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.390
It'll all fall apart...

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.520
Like a marimo youkan?

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.650
Like a marimo youkan?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.660
He smells good...

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.620
Yano... there's some strange rumors going around.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.630
Strange rumors?

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:27.380
That you've become a miser.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.680
Are you saving up for a hotel room...?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:37.640
Yeah... my house is just too dangerous.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.680
And I don't know when my parents will be out again.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.020
Ah... about that...

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:46.190
I've done a lot of thinking about it too, but...

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:51.690
I... kinda think that love hotels...

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.240
...are not really what I want.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.320
Ah, yeah.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.580
Yeah... you're right, I guess.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.700
You'd prefer...

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.000
Since we kinda rushed the other day...

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:07.080
...I was thinking I really want to make it something special in the right situation.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.840
If you're going out of your way, I'd like to go somewhere like hot springs or the beach.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:10.960
That way it'll become a memory, right?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.470
Y-Yeah.

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:14.550
I... guess so...

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.890
It'll... become a... memory...

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.680
The hotel fee... the train fee...

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:25.350
And if it were Tokyo Disneyland, it would be even better!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.530
How much is that...?

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:33.030
H-How much would that all cost?

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:35.240
And so... here!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.620
Let's both save up, little by little.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:41.830
It might take some time, but I'm sure we'll double the happiness!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.330
H-Huh?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.580
W-We'll save up?

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.580
We'll really both save up for it?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.090
Yeah!

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.220
O-Okay.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.090
I'll gamble on Takahashi's smile.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.050
I wonder if it'll take about half a year?

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.010
And it's really okay with you, right?

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.270
Yeah!

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:06.350
We'll probably have enough in time for our graduation class trip...

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.360
I sometimes think...

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.860
Takeuchi!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.280
This is the newest issue!

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.870
Oh! Let me see!

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:26.750
...that the happiness I feel right now once belonged to someone else long ago.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:40.680
I sorta feel like I'm being gypped here.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.100
I definitely am.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.400
How much have you saved so far?

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.900
721 yen.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.450
It sure is pretty.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:00.740
Yeah.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:03.910
Yano...

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:09.040
Let's go see the fireworks this summer.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.420
It's my dream.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.670
Okay.

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:19.180
I want to go to the festival, the Kiri Festival, and the beach, all together with you!

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:21.430
Let's create a ton of memories together.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.440
I don't really like the word "memory".

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.150
Why not?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:40.110
No reason. In my Japanese class in elementary school, I read a story.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.070
What story?

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.910
A story called "What Color Was That Girl's Dress?"

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:44.620
Heard of it?

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.410
Nope...

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:50.040
Two girls, named A and B are recalling an old story together.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:54.420
They get into this discussion about a picture hanging on the wall of one of the staircase landings in their elementary school.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:59.420
A picture of a girl picking flowers in front of a deep red sunset...

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:01.380
You really never read this?

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.430
Nope.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:09.430
A says, "Oh! How nostalgic. You're talking about the picture of the girl in a pretty yellow dress, right?"

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:16.440
But then B says, "No, the dress she was wearing was red, just like the sunset!"

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.780
"No, it was red!"

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:19.940
"No, it was definitely yellow."

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:23.570
"Alright, then why don't we go see for ourselves?"

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:31.290
The two of them, filled with excitement, reached the old, nostalgic school building.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.170
"What color was that girl's dress?"

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:37.420
What color was it?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.680
It...

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.180
...didn't have a color.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.560
It was just a black and white picture.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:55.770
The dress that dark silhouette wore was scribbled completely black.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:21:00.690
Yet in their memories, both bickering girls were sure that the dress in the picture had a color.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:05.490
See? Human memories are too vague.

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:10.580
Thinking something has color when it doesn't, making things more dramatic than they really are, glorifying things...

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:13.710
It gives new, greater meaning than was actually there.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:18.000
That's why I don't believe any of this talk about "beautiful memories".

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.220
What do you believe in, then?

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:27.220
You.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.220
Absolutely you.

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:34.730
What's right in front of me now.

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:45.740
Nana, wanna come shopping with me today?

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.660
Shoot! I dropped her stuff all over the place!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:52.450
Whose is this?

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.700
Yamamoto-san's.

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:54.580
She'll get really mad at us.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.000
I have a copy of this, too.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.550
So Yamamoto-san also reads poetry books...

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:04.300
...even though she's always reading all that hard stuff, too.

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:10.350
Nana, hurry up and give it!

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:11.560
Ah, yeah!

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:15.770
She won't notice we dropped it, right?

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:48.470
W-What am I gonna do? I took it as soon as I saw it.

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:52.930
They're a little younger, and...

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.350
...it's Yano, and to his left, Takeuchi-kun.

00:22:56.430 --> 00:23:01.770
And... this is probably... Nana-san.

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:17.000
Why does Yamamoto-san have...
